   "h": 55
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "value": "《词与物》脉络梳理"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "value": "在《性经验史》中，福柯通过对性发展历史的梳理，得出“权力已渗透于最私密的性领域，对人加以塑造”的结论，从而表达出对权力的批判态度。"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "src": "/api/books/a325bbdc496e/image/a325bbdc496e_940bfa78d4.webp",
   "alt": "",
   "w": 501,
   "h": 281
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "src": "/api/books/a325bbdc496e/image/a325bbdc496e_1aeed29d58.webp",
   "alt": "",
   "w": 152,
   "h": 55
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "value": "《规训与惩罚》脉络梳理"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "src": "/api/books/a325bbdc496e/image/a325bbdc496e_5c0dbe9122.webp",
   "alt": "",
   "w": 501,
   "h": 239
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
